<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>20260831 5-20日主线分析（按401板块） | A股复盘选股中心</title><style>  * { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }
  body { font-family: system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif; background:#f0f2f5; color:#1a1a2e; }
