  @media (max-width:600px){ .container{padding:0 10px;} table{font-size:10px;} th,td{padding:6px 3px;} .stock-code{font-size:9px;} .table-wrap{overflow-x:auto;} .theme-summary{font-size:14px; padding:12px 14px 12px 30px;} .theme-summary::before{position:absolute; left:14px; top:12px;} .theme-role{flex:0 0 72px;} .theme-name-wrap{flex:1 1 auto; white-space:nowrap; overflow:visible;} .theme-meta{flex:0 0 calc(100% - 72px); margin-left:72px; margin-top:2px; white-space:nowrap; font-size:11px;} .basis-summary{position:relative; padding-left:30px;} .basis-summary::before{position:absolute; left:14px; top:14px;} .part-header{font-size:17px;} .part-header .date-range{font-size:12px;} }</style></head><body><div class="header"><a class="back" href="mainlines_concept.html">&#8592; 返回</a><h1>5-20日主线分析（按401板块）</h1><div class="report-date">20260831（周一）</div><div class="subtitle">行业分类口径：通达信401板块（行业+细分+概念，自动读取）| 5日 / 10日 / 20日 主线研判</div></div><div class="container"><div class="section"><div class="section-title">市场环境 · 指数概览</div><div class="table-wrap"><table class="idx-table" id="idx-table"><colgroup><col style="width:25%"><col style="width:25%"><col style="width:25%"><col style="width:25%"></colgroup><thead><tr><th class="sortable">指数</th><th class="sortable">5日<br>涨跌幅</th><th class="sortable">10日<br>涨跌幅</th><th class="sortable">20日<br>涨跌幅</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="stock-name">深证成指</td><td class="up">+1.60%</td><td class="down">-4.69%</td><td class="up">+4.21%</td></tr><tr><td class="stock-name">沪深300</td><td class="up">+1.36%</td><td class="down">-2.45%</td><td class="up">+1.80%</td></tr><tr><td class="stock-name">创业板指</td><td class="up">+0.20%</td><td class="down">-8.06%</td><td class="up">+4.12%</td></tr><tr><td class="stock-name">上证指数</td><td class="up">+2.69%</td><td class="up">+0.09%</td><td class="up">+4.64%</td></tr><tr><td class="stock-name">北证50</td><td class="up">+1.11%</td><td class="down">-3.88%</td><td class="down">-1.00%</td></tr><tr><td class="stock-name">科创50</td><td class="up">+5.12%</td><td class="down">-5.84%</td><td class="up">+8.47%</td></tr><tr><td class="stock-name">中证500</td><td class="up">+3.05%</td><td class="down">-2.84%</td><td class="up">+7.25%</td></tr><tr><td class="stock-name">中证1000</td><td class="up">+3.72%</td><td class="down">-2.48%</td><td class="up">+9.76%</td></tr><tr><td class="stock-name">中证全指</td><td class="up">+1.77%</td><td class="down">-1.52%</td><td class="up">+5.59%</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="part-header">第一部分：5日主线分析 <span class="date-range">(近5个交易日(含当日))</span></div><div class="market-env">5日维度来看，中证全指+1.77%，科创50领涨，市场呈偏强格局；板块层面，资金围绕以下方向抱团，详见下方主线研判。</div><div class="section-title">主线研判</div><details class="theme-details dt-main" open><summary class="theme-summary"><span class="theme-role"><span class="theme-type type-role-main">主线</span></span><span class="theme-name-wrap">种业</span><span class="theme-meta">5日 <b><span class="up">+12.65%</span></b> · 10日 <b><span class="up">+21.15%</span></b> · 20日 <b><span class="up">+27.22%</span></b></span></summary><div class="theme-data"><div class="logic"><b>龙头梯队：</b>大北农、神农种业、万向德农；核心梯队：万向德农、敦煌种业、神农种业<br><b>性质：</b>长短周期共振向上，<b>趋势性/基本面驱动</b>性质（5/10/20日同向向上）；<br><b>持续性评估：较强。</b><br><b>原因：</b>区间涨幅在全部 401 个板块中排名第 1（前 0.2%），相对中证全指跑赢 +10.88 个百分点，核心个股近5日累计成交约 270 亿，领涨股 万向德农 近5日涨 <span class="up">+61.04%</span>。</div><details class="stock-section"><summary class="stock-section-title">核心个股明细（按当日市值降序，5日口径）</summary><div class="table-wrap"><table class="stock-table" id="stock-table-880710"><colgroup><col style="width:22%"><col style="width:19%"><col style="width:19%"><col style="width:19%"><col style="width:21%"></colgroup><thead><tr><th class="sortable">个股</th><th class="sortable desc">当日市值(亿)</th><th class="sortable">当日成交额(亿)</th><th class="sortable">涨幅(5日)</th><th class="sortable">备注</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="stock-name">大北农<span class="stock-code">002385</span></td><td class=" cell-cap">130</td><td class="">20</td><t